---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/TextPage.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Garanty Studios"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}

	<p>
		Garanty Studios started as a personal dream, driven by a passion for game development and the desire to create games independently.
		Myk founded Garanty Studios in 2021 and has been the owner, founder, and developer behind its projects ever since.
		Based in Germany, what started as a small personal project slowly grew into something more, while still remaining a largely independent and personal journey.
	</p>


	<p>
		The studio's first official project was A NOT Troll Game. Its early Beta 0.1 version was released on itch.io on August 20, 2022 — a simple troll-style platformer released on Myk's birthday.
		What began as a small experiment continued to grow through ongoing development and updates, eventually leading to Version 1.5 and its long-awaited release on Steam.
	</p>


	<p>
		July 13, 2023 became an important milestone for both A NOT Troll Game and Garanty Studios.
		It marked the Steam release of the game and the beginning of a new chapter.
		Today, the date is officially celebrated as the game's release anniversary, while also honoring July 13, 2022, connecting the Steam release with the year of the original itch.io launch.
		Together, these milestones represent an important part of how the journey began.
		A NOT Troll Game went on to reach several thousand players, giving Garanty Studios a strong foundation for what came next.
	</p>


	<p>
		On June 1, 2024, Garanty Studios released its second official commercial project, the beta version of Magic Masters.
		This mobile game focuses on real-time action, allowing players to use magic to fight against skeleton enemies.
		Although it did not reach the same numbers as A NOT Troll Game, the project became an important part of Myk's development journey and helped expand the experience behind Garanty Studios.
	</p>

	<p>
		Today, Garanty Studios remains an independent, founder-led studio.
		There is no large team behind it — just one developer, one founder, and a growing collection of ideas and projects.
		And the story continues...
	</p>

</Layout>

